  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme Funded Post - Delivering Accelerated Family Planning in Pakistan (DAFPAK) Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An in-house programme funded is likely to improve effectiveness of programme interventions to influence the programme work at a bigger scale for both partners and government counterparts. DAFPAK is a complex, high value (&#xa3;120m) programme in its seventh year of implementation that aims to improve access and quality of Family Planning Services. I.e. programme efforts are likely to be better sustained. Improved effectiveness across the portfolio to manage relationships with key government stakeholders and work with the institutional strengthening partner to strengthen programme coordination, effectiveness and sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
